  (text "HARDWARE DEFAULT-OFF: Q1 is enhancement-mode; R4 holds Vgs = 0 whenever IO26 is high-Z (reset, boot, unflashed,\nboard removed) or JP1 is open. No inverting stage exists that could turn the pump ON from a floating input.\nIO26 chosen because it is not a strapping pin and is not driven during boot (verify on actual module)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 71.12 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "18637809-2aaa-5784-a2d8-40565ef0e7fc")
  )
  (text "BLOCKED FOR ROUTING: pump current path (J2-F2-J3-Q1-R5-PGND) widths, fuse rating, shunt value and Q1 adequacy\nrequire measured pump running/stall current. Layout leaves these connections unrouted (ratsnest) on purpose."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 157.48 0)
    (effects
